Piura-Variables-*.csv
g4.areaAvgTimeSeries.*.csv
!docs/**/*.csv
*.hdf
*.hdf5
*.h5
*.nc
*.nc4
*.tif
*.tiff
*.shp
*.shx
*.dbf
*.zip

